cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or data, please cite the article (preferred-citation) and this repository."
title: "Code and data for: Urban enrichment of molestus ancestry and opposing temperature clines in a metropolitan Culex pipiens hybrid zone"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code, small inputs, result tables and figures for a whole-genome
  Pool-seq study of 24 field Culex pipiens pools across the Baltimore-Washington
  corridor and three reference pools, identifying three environmentally
  structured loci with different donor lineages, architectures and
  environmental gradients.
